'''''The Bad Batch'' Season 2''' is the second season of ''[[Star Wars: The Bad Batch]]'', which was announced on [[August 5]], [[2021]]. It released on [[January 4]], [[2023]] with a [[Spoils of War|two]]-[[Ruins of War|episode]] premiere, and concluded on [[March 29]], [[2023]], also with a [[The Summit|two]]-[[Plan 99 (episode)|episode]] finale. The season spans from [[19 BBY]] to [[18 BBY]].

==Official description==
''When the new season of "Star Wars: The Bad Batch" opens, months have passed since the events on Kamino, and the Bad Batch continue their journey navigating the Empire after the fall of the Republic. They will cross paths with friends and foes, both new and familiar, as they take on a variety of thrilling mercenary missions that will take them to unexpected and dangerous new places.''<ref name="Press Kit">{{Disney|subdomain=press|domain=co.uk|url=press-kit/star-wars:-the-bad-batch-season-2|text=Star Wars: The Bad Batch, Season 2 Press Kit}}</ref>

==Development==
''The Bad Batch'' Season 2 was first announced on [[August 5]], [[2021]] on [[StarWars.com]], with a [[2022]] release date.<ref name="Announcement" /> On [[January 25]], 2022,<ref name="Titan">{{TitanComics|url=m/95-star-wars-insider-208|text=Star Wars Insider #208}}</ref> [[Star Wars Insider 208|issue 208]] of ''[[Star Wars Insider]]'' stated that it would release in Spring 2022.<ref name="Insider 208">{{InsiderCite|208|Launchpad}}</ref> The [[Star Wars Insider 209|next issue]], however, removed the season and stated only the year.<ref name="Insider 209">{{InsiderCite|209|Launchpad}}</ref> At [[Celebration Anaheim (2022)|Star Wars Celebration Anaheim]], a panel was held for the show on [[May 29]], 2022,<ref name="Celebration">{{SW|url=news/star-wars-celebration-anaheim-panel-schedule-2022|text=Check Out the ''Star Wars'' Celebration Anaheim 2022 Panel Schedule}}</ref> after which a trailer was released which stated that the season would be released in the fall.<ref name="Official Trailer">{{SWYouTube|6JX5OW8cOec|Star Wars: The Bad Batch &#124; Season 2 Teaser Trailer &#124; Disney+}}</ref> [[Disney+]] later stated a [[September 28]] release date,<ref name="S2 Date">{{WebCite|url=https://comicbook.com/starwars/news/star-wars-the-bad-batch-season-2-release-date-revealed|text=Star Wars: The Bad Batch Season 2 Release Date Revealed|author=Outlaw, Kofi|date=2022-06-03|work=[https://comicbook.com ComicBook]|archivedate=20220604041646}}</ref> though the series was not included when the listings for [[September]] 2022 were released.<ref name="Disney Media">{{Disney|subdomain=dmedmedia|url=news/next-on-disney-plus-september-2022|text=Next on Disney+: September 2022}}</ref> The season was given a [[January 4]], [[2023]] release date at D23 that month. It was also announced that the season will have 16 episodes and feature a two-episode premiere, midseason, and finale.<ref name="D23" />

